<pb n="406" facs="#f0416"/>
<fw type="header" place="top"><hi rendition="#g">Zweite Abtheilung</hi>.</fw> <lb/>
<sp who="#Herr"> <speaker><hi rendition="#g">Herr</hi>.</speaker> <p>Er &#x017F;oll u&#x0364;berge&#x017F;chnappt &#x017F;eyn. I&#x017F;t es<lb/>
